      "mergeID": "63d007bb8037c9166133d661",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I would like to have the option of not showing members in order to loosely \"solidarize\" for a particular cause (e.g. \"love the public\").\n\n特定の主張（「publicを愛せよ」など）のためにゆるく\"連帯\"するために、メンバーを見せないオプションがほしいです。\n\nOr there may be some other demand.\n\nIf you can think of any other use cases, please write them in the comments.\n\nあるいは何か他の需要もあるかも知れません。\n\n他のユースケースを思いついた人はコメントに書いていただけると\n\nThis is the following canny made in the Group category anew.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1261-group-option-to-not-show-members",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1261] [Group] Option to NOT show members",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6389bd25721642387a58c391",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "By default, you can only see friends and likewise. Being able to see all of the members is a role toggle. \n\nDo you mean for there to be a toggle to let those in the role be completely hidden?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
